  "@type": [
    "schema:Dataset"
  ],
  "schema:name": "General Building Permits",
  "schema:description": "List of issued building permits from the City of Edmonton - Urban Planning & Economy Department for the public to do construction or maintenance on a structure located in the City. Note - All records start from January 1, 2009.\nPlease note : the decision was made to not release applicant information on this dataset as it was seen as a potential privacy issue. For instance, if a high profile member of the public were to apply for a permit, their name (and consequently address) would show up on this table and become easily searchable by the public.  We viewed this as a potential issue and decided to publish the dataset without applicant information.\n\nAlso Note: The General Building Permits dataset now includes an \"Occupancy Date\" to indicate when a building has met the requirements for use or habitation. \n- Residential: Permits finalized on or after January 1, 2022.\n- Non-Residential: Permits completed on or after January 1, 2024, only if an occupancy record exists.\n- Historical Data: Records before these dates are blank for accuracy, or if no permit was required.\n- Usage: For trend analysis only; not a legal confirmation of occupancy for property transactions.",
  "schema:identifier": "24uj-dj8v",
